# For the Birds (otherAreas 104): the edges. A fresh log: Koblakiq: Missionary's 7 (For off: Missionary not completed).
# Missionary completed (a GM) with its mustZone (a GM: 11): For off: Missionary's 12. Cleared (a GM): 14, option 0 and
# 2: nothing. Accepted (a GM): Koblakiq Prog 3, 5 and -1 (GMs): nil (13). Daa Bola: a feather: nil; a root and a feather
# (tradeHas: not exact) at Prog 2 (a GM): 87, finished: the root taken, the feather kept, Prog 1 (back from 2),
# mustZone. Daa Bola Prog 1 with the mustZone cleared (a GM): nil (HERETICS). GeFhu Prog 0 and 1: nil (HUURR). Prog 2 (a
# GM) with no fragment: the spawn arm takes it all the same (TAKEN_FROM_YOU). A Magnes' and a Nickel's death at Prog 2,
# and the other two at Prog 4: the Option kept (the main flow counts them at Prog 3). Koblakiq Prog 4 with a full
# inventory: 18, finished: quest:complete fails (the mantle): no mustZone, still accepted: 18 again, finished with room:
# completed.
lists OldtonMovalpolos/Koblakiq/onTrigger OldtonMovalpolos/onEventFinish/7 OldtonMovalpolos/onEventFinish/14 OldtonMovalpolos/onEventFinish/18 CastleOztroja/Daa_Bola_the_Seer/onTrigger CastleOztroja/Daa_Bola_the_Seer/onTrade CastleOztroja/onEventFinish/87 Beadeaux/GeFhu_Yagudoeye/onTrigger Beadeaux/Magnes_Quadav_NM/onMobDeath Beadeaux/Nickel_Quadav_NM/onMobDeath Beadeaux/onZoneOut/1
char zone=OldtonMovalpolos pos=-63.4,22.8,-117.5 job=WAR lvl=75
item ArnicaRoot
item ChocoboFeather x2
